# Keeps the build context small and prevents secrets/large artifacts from
# ever reaching a Docker build (#770). All three service Dockerfiles build
# from the repo root — see asp/Dockerfile, publisher/Dockerfile,
# relayer/Dockerfile for why.
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/data
**/.opaque-relayer
**/dist
**/target
artifacts
circuits/build
frontend/dist
frontend/node_modules
*.log
